    {
      "text": "CTCAC application CA-26-755: 113 total units, 112 low-income. Application, not an award: bond request $21,128,698, federal credit request $3,995,245 (CDLAC September 8, 2026 applicant list).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001612"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC application CA-26-755: one six-story building, 113 units (112 low-income at 30% to 70% AMI plus one manager unit), 160 parking spaces on 2.05 acres in census tract 5125.13 (Qualified Census Tract). Site on a 99-year ground lease from Safehold Inc. Land use: High Density Residential, identified as a by-right Housing Element site; zoning R4, 30 units/acre current and 56.5 units/acre proposed. Application lists site acquisition May 2026, building permit May 2027, construction June 2027 to June 2029.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001612"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC application ownership: CRP Monterey LP, with Community Revitalization and Development Corporation (nonprofit, Redding) as managing general partner and CRP Monterey AGP LLC as administrative general partner.",
